  "instagram_caption": "Baby oil can wreck a condom in 60 seconds 😳\n\nMost condoms already come with lube in the wrapper, and adding more water-based or silicone lube is fine (it can even help stop breaks). But in one lab test, 60 seconds of mineral oil, found in baby oil and many lotions, cut latex condom strength by about 90%.\n\nWith latex condoms: no Vaseline, no lotion, no coconut oil.\n\nSources: Contraception journal (1989), Planned Parenthood, Bedsider, NHS.\n\nDid you know condoms come pre-lubed?\n\n#docstick #contraception #sexeducation #safersex #bodyfacts",
  "youtube_title": "Baby Oil Can Wreck a Condom in 60 Seconds",
